---
import Accordion from '../molecules/Accordion.astro'

const items = [
  {
    q: 'When is Insighty launching?',
    a: "We're targeting a Q2 2026 early-access launch for waitlist members. Founding members will get first access, locked pricing, and direct input on the roadmap before we open to the public.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What size agency is Insighty built for?',
    a: "Insighty is designed for digital agencies with 2–50 people — the range where spreadsheets break down but enterprise tools are overkill. If you're managing retainers, fixed projects, and hosting costs across multiple clients, Insighty is built for you.",
  },
  {
    q: 'How is Insighty different from tools like Asana, Jira, or Monday?',
    a: "Those tools track tasks. Insighty tracks money. We connect project status directly to invoicing, forecasting, and margin — so you know not just what's in progress, but what it's worth and when it pays. Think of it as the financial operating layer your project tools are missing.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What is Pixel AI and what can it do?',
    a: "Pixel AI is Insighty's built-in intelligence layer. It reads your actual data — projects, invoices, pipeline, costs — and surfaces insights automatically. Ask it why margin dipped last month, which client is most at risk of churn, or what the next 90 days look like if you close two pending deals. It answers in plain language, not charts you have to interpret yourself.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I migrate from spreadsheets?',
    a: "Yes. Insighty supports CSV import for projects, clients, and historical invoices. We're also building a guided onboarding flow that walks you through mapping your existing data into the system. For founding members, we'll offer white-glove migration support.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Is my data secure and private?',
    a: "Absolutely. Your financial and client data is encrypted at rest and in transit. We never sell data or use it to train shared AI models. Each workspace is fully isolated, and we're GDPR-compliant. Your numbers stay yours.",
  },
]
---
<!-- =========================
FAQ section
===========================-->
<section id="faq" class="py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-28 bg-background-3 dark:bg-background-7">
  <div class="main-container">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center mb-10 xl:mb-16">
      <span data-ns-animate data-delay="0.1" class="inline-block border border-secondary/25 text-secondary text-tagline-3 font-medium tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-1.5">FAQ</span>
      <h2 data-ns-animate data-delay="0.2" class="mx-auto max-w-[600px]">
        Questions we keep getting
      </h2>
      <p data-ns-animate data-delay="0.3" class="mx-auto max-w-[480px]">
        Everything you need to know before joining the waitlist.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[950px]">
      <Accordion items={items} openFirst={true} />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
